      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Sistema</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">📋 Manual de usuario</a></li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://dga.unsa.edu.ar/docvs/patrimonio/intranet/centro_diaguita/#extension"
              target="_blank"
              ><svg
                class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-800 dark:text-white"
                aria-hidden="true"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="24"
                height="24"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M12 13V4M7 14H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2m-1-5-4 5-4-5m9 8h.01"
                ></path>
              </svg>
              Descargar extensión</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="http://diaguita.unsa.edu.ar/diaguita/" target="_blank"
              >↗ SIU Diaguita Producción</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="http://diaguitadev.unsa.edu.ar/diaguita/" target="_blank"
              >↗ SIU Diaguita Desarrollo</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Institución</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.unsa.edu.ar" target="_blank">↗ UNSa</a></li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://dga.unsa.edu.ar/docvs/patrimonio/intranet/index.php"
              target="_blank">🔐 Intranet Patrimonio</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Contacto</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:patrimonio@rectorado.unsa.edu.ar"
              >📧 Correo Patrimonio</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Universidad+Nacional+de+Salta/@-24.7276565,-65.4099398,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x941bc113ff725893:0x2981a8b51a8d1fbd!8m2!3d-24.7276565!4d-65.4099398!16s%2Fm%2F047lkmq?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MTAwNy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"
              target="_blank">📍 Av. Bolivia 5150 - Salta CP 4400 Argentina</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="tel:8695" target="_blank">📞 Telefono interno</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
